  }

  /* ── Split section headers ────────────────────────────
     Two problems with the plain .section-header pattern here: (1) its lead
     paragraph caps at --max-width-text, leaving an unbalanced gap of empty
     space to the right whenever the content below it (segment slider,
     approach card, stat grid) runs full width; (2) putting the eyebrow
     inside the same column as the title pushed the lead paragraph's top
     edge up to align with the small eyebrow tag instead of the headline
     itself, so title and body copy looked like two unrelated blocks
     instead of one aligned row.
     Fixed with a two-row grid: the eyebrow spans the full width on its
